Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 22:02:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Admin: approve or reject app versions

A version is only offered for download once approved (an app's page shows
its latest approved version), but the admin page had no way to approve
one: the server's PATCH /admin/apps/:id/versions/:versionId/review was
never called. Approving an app left its versions pending, so its Download
button stayed off (PRIMERS OS 1.0.0-rc1, Pronexa).

- App details: "Approve version" and "Reject version" on each version
  (reject asks first), with a note that a version isn't offered for
  download until approved.
- App list: a "N versions to review" badge, and a "Versions to review"
  filter that lists apps of any status with a version waiting (an
  approved app's new version didn't show under "Pending").
- The version review route returns the updated version; the admin app
  list includes each app's pending_versions count.
- test/admin-versions.test.js: admins only, the right version of the
  right app, unknown statuses refused, the count and the filter (5 tests;
  12 of 12 pass). Checked in a browser against the built client: the
  badge, the buttons, and the PATCH they send.

